alization the numbers of younger  people in  hospital are have gone up and that means  that the numbers younger people  are thankfully more likely to survive so  we know the length of stay  is longer and they more often are are  needing icu care so the percentage of  younger people who are in  icu has gone up  research has shown the p1 variant is up  to two and a half times more  transmissible and  though more research is needed there's  some evidence in brazil that it can  infect people who have been vaccinated  and possibly re-infect people who have  already recovered from cobit 19.  well hockey is on hold for the vancouver  canucks after five more players tested  positive for covid 19 placing more  strain on the nhl season schedule  seven players and one staff member are  now in covid 19 protocol and that number  could rise  the team may be allowed to practice  again on tuesday and the next three  games against the edmonton oilers and  the winnipeg jets have been postponed  under the nhl's guidelines players and  staff are required to take a covid test  every day in washington d.c another  capitol police officer has been killed  in an attack  in the heart of that city a car rammed  into a security barrier killing one  officer and injuring another  it happened just after 1 pm local time  on a day when no u.s politicians were  inside the capitol  congress is in recess right now jackson  prosco is near the scene tonight jackson  bring us up to speed on what we know  including about the suspect  and donna they're actually just towing  the car away from the scene right now as  the investigation continues  into what led up to this incident today  it plunged the capitol complex into  lockdown  as this vehicle rammed a security  checkpoint on the senate side  the driver is identified as a  25-year-old again motive is still  unclear at this point  two capitol police officers were struck  they opened fire and killed the suspect  but listen to how u.s capitol police  descri